Package: unitcm
Version: 0.1.0
Title: R Client for the UniTCM Traditional Chinese Medicine Platform
Description: Provides functions to query the UniTCM API
    <https://UniTCM.cn/api/v1/>, covering herb exploration,
    compound/ADMET data, disease-formula associations, TCM ontology,
    transcriptomics, and gene-disease analysis (MIDAS).
